      "statement": "dispatch_agent_run routes Slack, Linear, GitHub, dashboard, and background triggers through create_durable_run, which applies durable LangGraph defaults: multitask_strategy='interrupt' (halts active run, preserves checkpoint, resumes with history), durability='async' (checkpoints before each step), stream_resumable=True (enables event replay), Protocol v3 configuration (stream_mode, stream_subgraphs), and if_not_exists='create'.",
